<title>THAILAND: SITCA unit to issue debentures.</title>
<headline>SITCA unit to issue debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's SITCA Investment and Securities Plc said on Wednesday its wholly-owned subsidiary Metropolis Trust and Securities Plc, planned to issue debentures worth up to 3.0 billion baht ($115 million).  </p>
<p>The debentures will have maturity of no more than five years and six months and will be issued in baht and foreign currencies, SITCA said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>Other details and conditions of the bond issue would be decided by Metropolis Trust and Securities, it added.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
